WEBVTT

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:13.710
At the very least,
you should notice it before getting on the bus.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.010
It's too late to shout "Oh no! I forgot something!" once you've boarded it.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.500
I'm sorry.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.710
My friend Kazama...

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.330
...likes cute girls.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:53.660
I, Murasame Sumika...

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.880
...have always had feelings for her...

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.560
Huh? Tomoe-chan?

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:08.560
What's wrong?

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:15.550
It's nothing.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.560
Let's go home, Miyako.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:59.710
I want to kiss a cute girl too.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.620
This again?

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.720
Yeah.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.880
Oh, where could you be?

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:14.470
You breathtakingly beautiful girl together with whom I'll weave an enchanting ballad of love.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.730
Why not raise a flag, ring chimes,
and beat a drum?

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.890
Oh, that's so mean!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.800
That'd make me look like a weird person.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:31.890
By the way, Ushio-chan,
when did you have your first kiss?

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.750
I-I? My, Kiyori-chan...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.080
Don't ask me such weird questions.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.230
Oh, come on!

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.760
You pretty much only talk
about weird things anyway.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.030
Well, I guess...

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.550
So, was it with a girl?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.130
Not yet.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.860
Oh, I see.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.020
So cute! Damn it!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:17.810
That's why I'm nervous.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.050
It's a once-in-a-lifetime experience.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.630
Shouldn't it be a wonderful memory?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:27.860
What if I make a mistake when the time comes?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.450
Oh, I know what you mean!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:35.160
Like how, when I'm on stage with the brass band,
I'm always worried about making a mistake.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.800
Well, in the end it comes down
to how much I've practiced.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.240
That's it!

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:43.940
Wh-What is?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.530
Practice — it's all about practice!

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:50.530
To be prepared when the time comes, I need to practice for my first kiss!

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.200
Oh, that won't do!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.550
Even if it's just practice,
it'll still be my first kiss!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:09.050
What is this about kissing, Kazama?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.350
Nothing...

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.070
Sit down.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.320
Next, Akemiya.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.170
Yes.

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:21.960
Translate the rest.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.590
Go for it — you can do it.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:31.340
Bob always gets the short end of the stick.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:40.750
His serious approach to things is often futile,
and so he has a secret way to alleviate stress.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:51.840
Oh, man.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.650
I guess that tension will be with us for a while.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.670
Still...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.730
...who were those two?

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.550
Are they both in our class?

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.090
One day, I will also...

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:23.920
I'm so sorry.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:28.020
I was thinking only of myself.

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:32.030
I didn't realize how you felt, Sumi-chan.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.390
It's fine, Kazama.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:39.410
I am at fault for not being more direct.

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.660
Sumi-chan.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.490
Kazama.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:57.880
Even if it's just practice...

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.800
...I'd like to do it.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:14.280
Hey, Kazama.

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.650
Everyone's watching.

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:18.930
Stop it.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.080
I'm sorry!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.890
Watch where you're going!

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.870
Say, Kiyori-chan,

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.590
would you like to wear a mask—

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.220
I must politely decline.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:53.880
Ask Murasame-san.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.230
Oh, Sumi-chan won't do.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:00.080
She's much taller than me.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.640
I just can't get into the mood.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.670
Then, how about that other girl?

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.900
The model.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.320
Akemi-chan?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.010
You're friends, right?

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:13.860
Well, it would be wonderful if I could do it with her.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.870
However, she never called me back, even though I gave her my number.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.290
I'm sure she's just busy at work.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.000
She's pretty popular.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.880
I'm sure you'll see her again.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.740
She lives nearby, after all.

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.590
Right, Kiyori-chan?

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:35.450
Well, I only heard about it
from my upperclassmen.

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:37.050
I've never met her myself.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.510
That's true.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:42.880
It's not impossible that my first kiss
will be with Akemi-chan.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:43.810
Huh?

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.330
I need to practice properly.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:52.590
There's only one first kiss.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:53.820
Well, of course.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.590
Say, Sumi-chan...

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.810
...could I borrow the keys to
the science lab after school?

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.940
Well, if you have a valid reason.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.580
But why?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:11.970
So, what do you plan to do with this?

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:15.210
We'll carry it to the classroom.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.970
It's just the perfect size to practice on.

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:22.070
The classroom, shimmering in
the haze of the setting sun.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:26.490
The silhouette of the two lovers glimmering in the golden glow.

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:31.480
Their forms slowly coalesce into one,
brilliantly illuminating the spring of their youth,

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:35.220
becoming a monument to last the ages!

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.250
Heh...

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.500
So you'll settle for anything
as long as the height's right?!

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:44.170
Besides, it's against the rules to take it out.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:05.530
I-If you ask me...

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:15.540
A first kiss in itself would be
a wonderful memory for life.

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.290
Even if it's not so perfect.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:23.300
Even if you make a mistake and embarrass yourself.

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:27.570
As long as you can do it with
the one you truly love...

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.100
...that's all that matters.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:44.070
Sumi-chan?

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.610
Murasame-san!

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:56.050
The teacher was calling for you.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:59.820
I... see.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.790
See you later, Kazama.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:14.000
Did I just do something terribly wrong?

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.710
Murasame-san?

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.620
Ah, I want to kiss someone.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:26.400
I-If you're okay with me...

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:27.720
Huh?!

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:44.550
Sumika has returned to the dojo?!

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.760
Oh, Master!

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.210
She suddenly dropped in,
just a while ago.

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:51.330
Oh, what a terrific strike!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.750
It's full of spirit.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:02.020
You've been trained in martial arts from a young age,
and I hoped that you would one day succeed me.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:09.160
Why are you giving up karate, Sumika?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.780
Because it's not cute!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.280
That was one year ago.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:21.530
I knew it — the fiery passion for martial arts still burns quietly within you.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:27.520
She'd take that thing over me?

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:32.910
Kazama... doesn't think about me at all.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.570
Good morning, Sumi-chan.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.240
Good morning.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:03.820
Say, are you free after school today?

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:08.570
Yeah.

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:11.330
Then, promise me something.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:16.910
Wait for me in the classroom.
Say, around 5:30.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:30.140
The weather's great today.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.600
I'm sure it'll be a beautiful sunset.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.260
Sunset?

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:58.360
Could it be?

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:06.950
Could it be?!

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:31.740
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.160
No, not at all.

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:36.930
Sumi-chan.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.650
Chest!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.450
It's "tansu."

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.450
A "chest" is called a "seiridansu" in Japanese.

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.210
Any other questions?

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.460
No, nothing.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:06.090
So, we've had this happen before.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.330
Is this a new trend in this class?

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.340
All right, start from the top again, Akemiya.

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:27.550
It couldn't be... could it?

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:10.820
Kazama...

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:16.550
...doesn't have any feelings for me.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.500
She doesn't think of me...

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:27.380
...in that way.

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:31.470
Sorry to keep you waiting, Sumi-chan.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.170
Kazama.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:37.460
What a relief that it's still clear.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:41.300
I was a little nervous when it
clouded over around noon.

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:48.670
In the end, I guess it just has to be sunset.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:03.660
I'm so sorry; I've only been thinking about myself.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:08.380
I didn't realize how you felt, Sumi-chan.

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:11.670
All right!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:15.210
I had no idea that you had someone you liked.

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:17.740
I fail as a friend.

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:19.700
Even though we're always together.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:23.160
It finally dawned on me after the conversation yesterday, though.

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:26.610
Good luck! I'll support you with all I have!

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:27.310
Huh?

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.710
Therefore,

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:33.210
today will be your first lesson in kissing.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.250
Sumi-chan?

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:39.470
Your lips.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:41.470
Here.

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:48.320
Sumi-chan, you're taller than the average boy.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:52.120
It'll be fine for you to do it with me, right?

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.500
Kazama...

00:18:56.730 --> 00:19:01.510
You said that you wouldn't mind if you made a mistake,
but it only happens once in a lifetime.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.860
So there's no harm in being prepared.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:12.730
I'm always dragging you along
at my pace, Sumi-chan.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.640
That's why it'd be nice if I could
help you once in a while.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.070
Here.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.490
Come on.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:39.480
Sumi-chan.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.600
Thank you.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:00.230
It's like a warzone, Tomoe-chan.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.020
So, those two as well?

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:42.350
Like I said, you just misunderstood.

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:47.420
I don't really have any boy I like.

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:55.160
Huh? Well, I can't deny it outright.

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.350
No, just talking to myself.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:04.510
I'll return it to you tomorrow.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:07.100
Bye.

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:08.950
Good night.

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:31.380
Did something happen to Sumika-san?

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:35.910
Teenage girls are very complicated.

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:37.580
Next time: 4+1
It's the preview!

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:39.090
So, it's you two now?

00:23:39.090 --> 00:23:40.500
We're the protagonists-to-be.

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:41.330
That's right!

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:42.310
You aren't, though...

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:42.330
Then, I'll designate you as
the president of the Girls' Club.

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:45.740
Next time: 4+1
Then, I'll designate you as

00:23:46.300 --> 00:23:46.400
Next time: 4+1

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.510
My, aren't we bashful.

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:51.400
Whatever. All right, see you next week.
